# Forest mosquito swarm (#645, D151): one mosquito of the cloud, native 5x4 frames, facing right; the game draws fourteen.
# dark1, dark2: wings up and flat (the 20 per second flicker), a dark belly; fed1, fed2: the same with a swollen crimson belly.
# dead: curled, wings down, as it drops when the swarm dies; ember: the same burning, in the fireball's ramp (P, Y, O, R).
# Danger family (#236): ink 0b0814, crimson 9c2050, rose c87896, pale rose wings f0d0dc / d09cac, the glowing eye ff6b57.
